1
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:21,550
&#9654; >> Jag vet.

2
00:20:21,550 --> 00:20:22,679
&#9654; [Musik]

3
00:20:22,679 --> 00:20:25,760
&#9654; >> Jag säger ju det John. Allt finns här.

4
